WEBVTT

00:02:27.236 --> 00:02:31.556
where 96 percent of the mass
of the mammals is us

00:02:31.596 --> 00:02:33.436
and our domesticated livestock.

00:02:34.596 --> 00:02:36.876
Only four percent is everything else,

00:02:36.916 --> 00:02:39.236
from pandas to tigers to elephants.

00:02:40.356 --> 00:02:44.516
And we have removed over 90 percent
of the large fish in the ocean

00:02:44.516 --> 00:02:46.196
in the last century alone.

00:02:46.756 --> 00:02:48.196
On top of the loss of nature,

00:02:48.236 --> 00:02:49.796
we have global warming.

00:02:50.436 --> 00:02:52.516
The summer of 2021 has seen

00:02:52.516 --> 00:02:55.556
some of the hottest temperatures
in human history,

00:02:55.596 --> 00:02:58.716
in places that one
would expect to be cool,

00:02:58.756 --> 00:03:01.516
like Canada, Finland and Siberia.